---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Ollie Worthington - founder of Underdog Digital. SEO, AI agents, design, and building in public from Melbourne."
>
  <Header active="about" />
  <main class="prose">
    <div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
      <header class="prose-header">
        <h1>About</h1>
      </header>
      <div class="content">
        <p>
          I'm Ollie - founder of <a href="https://underdog.digital">Underdog Digital</a>, an
          anti-agency SEO shop that does rankings and revenue without the meetings. Before that I
          spent years inside agencies watching the theatre happen from the inside.
        </p>
        <p>
          This site is my build log. I write about what I'm shipping and what I'm learning:
          technical SEO, AI agents doing real work, design systems, local-first tooling, and where
          search is heading now that the answer engines outnumber the search engines.
        </p>
        <p>
          The operating rule here is simple: build useful things, understand the internet, say what
          actually happened. No thought-leadership filler. If a post on this site says something
          worked, it's because I ran it and watched the numbers.
        </p>
        <p>
          Day to day I run client SEO through Underdog, build internal tools with AI agents, and
          spend an unreasonable amount of time on typography for someone who works in search.
        </p>

        <dl class="facts">
          <div>
            <dt>work</dt>
            <dd>Founder, Underdog Digital</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>lanes</dt>
            <dd>SEO · AI agents · design · local-first software</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>based</dt>
            <dd>Melbourne, Australia</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>elsewhere</dt>
            <dd>
              <a href="https://x.com/ollies0x">x.com/ollies0x</a> ·
              <a href="https://github.com/ollies0x">github.com/ollies0x</a>
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>this site</dt>
            <dd>Astro, static, hosted on GitHub Pages. Fast because it has to be.</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
